### Domain lookup - should return 401 (no key)
POST {{host}}/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "lookups": ["whois", "dns", "ssl", "headers"]
}

### Info - should return 403 (free key, admin only)
GET {{host}}/v1/info
X-API-Key: {{lookupKey}}

### Domain lookup with fingerprint (admin key - all plans)
POST {{host}}/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "lookups": ["fingerprint"]
}

### Domain lookup with fingerprint (free key - all plans)
POST {{host}}/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{lookupKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "lookups": ["fingerprint"]
}

### Domain lookup with headers + fingerprint — headers fetched once (admin key)
POST {{host}}/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "lookups": ["headers", "fingerprint"]
}

### Domain lookup — lookup names are normalized and deduped (admin key)
POST {{host}}/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "domains": ["  Example.COM  ", "https://example.com/"],
  "lookups": [" SSL ", "ssl", "DNS"]
}

### Domain lookup - should return 400 (lookups missing)
POST {{host}}/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"]
}

### Domain lookup - should return 400 (lookups empty)
POST {{host}}/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "lookups": []
}

### Domain lookup - should return 400 (lookups whitespace-only)
POST {{host}}/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "lookups": ["  "]
}

### Domain lookup - should return 400 (unknown lookup name)
POST {{host}}/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "lookups": ["dns", "banana"]
}

### Domain lookup - should return 403 (free key, threat_intel is pro-only)
POST {{host}}/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{freeKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "lookups": ["threat_intel"]
}

### Domain lookup with DNS security (free key - all plans)
POST {{host}}/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{freeKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "lookups": ["dns_security"]
}

### Domain lookup with DNS security (admin key)
POST {{host}}/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "lookups": ["dns_security"]
}

### Domain lookup with aggregate risk score (admin key)
# The risk score is computed from whichever other lookups you request, and costs no extra network call.
POST {{host}}/v1/domain/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "lookups": ["risk", "ssl", "headers", "email_security"]
}

### Invalidate auth cache (admin only)
POST {{host}}/v1/admin/auth/cache/invalidate
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Get fingerprint rules (admin only)
GET {{host}}/v1/admin/fingerprints
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Update fingerprint rules (admin only)
POST {{host}}/v1/admin/fingerprints
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

[
  {"name":"Nginx","category":"web-server","headers":{"Server":"nginx"}},
  {"name":"PHP","category":"language","headers":{"X-Powered-By":"PHP"},"cookies":["PHPSESSID"]},
  {"name":"Cloudflare","category":"cdn","headers":{"Server":"cloudflare","CF-RAY":""},"cookies":["__cflb"]}
]

### IP lookup (admin key)
POST {{host}}/v1/ip/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "ips": ["8.8.8.8"],
  "lookups": ["geo", "asn", "reverse_dns", "abuse_contact"]
}

### IP lookup with threat intel (pro key)
POST {{host}}/v1/ip/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{proKey}}

{
  "ips": ["8.8.8.8"],
  "lookups": ["threat_intel"]
}

### IP lookup - should return 403 (free key, threat intel)
POST {{host}}/v1/ip/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{freeKey}}

{
  "ips": ["8.8.8.8"],
  "lookups": ["threat_intel"]
}

### IP lookup - should return 400 (lookups missing)
POST {{host}}/v1/ip/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "ips": ["8.8.8.8"]
}

### IP lookup - should return 400 (whois is a domain-only lookup)
POST {{host}}/v1/ip/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "ips": ["8.8.8.8"],
  "lookups": ["whois"]
}

### IP lookup - should return 401 (no key)
POST {{host}}/v1/ip/lookup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ips": ["8.8.8.8"],
  "lookups": ["geo", "asn", "reverse_dns", "abuse_contact"]
}

### IP lookup - should return 400 (private IP)
POST {{host}}/v1/ip/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "ips": ["192.168.1.1"],
  "lookups": ["geo", "asn", "reverse_dns", "abuse_contact"]
}

### IP lookup - multiple IPs (admin key)
POST {{host}}/v1/ip/lookup
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "ips": ["8.8.8.8", "1.1.1.1"],
  "lookups": ["geo", "asn", "reverse_dns", "abuse_contact"]
}

### My usage (any plan)
GET {{host}}/v1/usage
X-API-Key: {{lookupKey}}

### My usage with custom window (any plan)
GET {{host}}/v1/usage?days=7
X-API-Key: {{lookupKey}}

### My usage - should return 401 (no key)
GET {{host}}/v1/usage

### Rotate API key (any plan) - returns a NEW key; old keys expire after the grace window
POST {{host}}/v1/keys/rotate
X-API-Key: {{lookupKey}}

### Usage statistics (admin only)
GET {{host}}/v1/admin/usage
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Usage statistics with filters (admin only)
GET {{host}}/v1/admin/usage?days=7&customer_id=1
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Changelog (admin only)
GET {{host}}/v1/admin/changelog
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Refresh the GeoIP database (admin only)
POST {{host}}/v1/admin/geoip/refresh
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Billing webhook (no auth, requires Stripe signature)
POST {{host}}/billing/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
Stripe-Signature: t=123,v1=test

{}

### Billing success page (no auth, requires session_id)
GET {{host}}/billing/success?session_id=cs_test_123
